    "updated_at": "2022-08-25T07:04:26Z",
    "body": "For the time being, I don't think we will release the type of event for the challenge set, as it might bias the tracking algorithms to learn specific tracking pattern based on that prior. If you are looking to ablate your method to different scenarios, I invite you to do it on a subset of the test set.",
